What is a Sandwich Bus Duct?
A Sandwich Bus Duct is a compact, high-efficiency busway system engineered for reliable power distribution in industrial facilities, commercial complexes, and high-rise buildings. Unlike conventional air-insulated bus ducts, sandwich bus ducts feature conductors tightly enclosed within high-grade insulating materials, resulting in superior heat dissipation, space optimization, and enhanced electrical performance. These systems are critical for applications requiring high current capacity, safety, and minimal energy loss.

Sandwich bus ducts are increasingly preferred in modern construction due to their modular design, ease of installation, and ability to support complex power distribution networks without compromising safety or efficiency.

